### Current business problems

| Problem | Business impact |
|---|---|
| Manual recurring invoices | Operational overhead |
| Disconnected checkout and subscription records | Customer onboarding friction |
| Failed recurring payments | Revenue leakage |
| Manual plan changes | Slow customer servicing |
| Limited trial conversion tracking | Lost acquisition opportunity |
| Payment and entitlement status disconnected | Incorrect service access |
| Poor churn visibility | Revenue uncertainty |

### Desired outcomes

1. Simplify subscription acquisition.
2. Automate recurring billing and collection where supported.
3. Reduce failed-payment leakage.
4. Improve trial-to-paid conversion.
5. Support commercial plan changes.
6. Improve subscription and revenue visibility.
7. Connect payment events with SaaS account access.

